XB-Kidux-Ages: 10-14
XB-Kidux-Before: gcompris
Description: Kidux learning module: Kig, geometry to move for ages ten to fourteen
 Kidux is a Debian derivative for a child's first computer. This learning
 module is Kig: points, lines, circles and shapes a child puts on a canvas
 and drags, each keeping its rule, the middle in the middle and the
 parallel parallel, in the child's language and without the internet.
 .
 Once it is installed, an adult switches it on for each child on the
 Modules page of the adult panel.
